<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces have increased border patrols and fired warning shots after Myanmar bombs damaged a health centre and artillery struck villages in Tak and Mae Sot, prompting a pause to unofficial trade. Myanmar police arrested 83 Thais in a border-hotel scam raid while Thailand boosted security on the Myanmar border and issued a Mae Hong Son alert over possible air strikes on Karen forces. Refugees from Myanmar are filling labor gaps as Cambodians return home, and cross-border QR payments are being introduced in Bangkok's historic shopping districts. A 15‑year-old Thai golfer was killed and a caddy injured by lightning at a tournament in Chachoengsao, and a Thai opposition leader was targeted in a spyware attack. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPT0hFWHdXT3NFQzVVVTVhNzl5dkUtVnVjZUlGd202TG1ERkluOW1MWk12TU8wUU40MW1kV0FYc2NqQVBJM0lvWk05Y1FFQUM0YWMzN0tTbkRvMlBwbXBpeTA3dVhvWEl3X1B6QVRjSXlCcjRGYmpZMnhpa0ZzOW1SQ0tSRXRKUTJZZWM2alBrbmpnWDdETzd0ZHBER3poSUdCcmVhY3lTWWZickVjVEtRd0ZIRFFBRDh4Wnhr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxOZjJrSnFoUS1NVHVGLWlncWdZd3kzNjNxWmJ3WTJlVnlrYkl0Si0tTmFJbFE0VW1LcmZNbFE5aTktYkNwWnVyaEw3aTdKZnZCMzRJcnRqN3FFMkhrUjFJNE5rYmlSQmVOS1BvY2FfZ0p3YmE0bXYybzhKLU9pZEtsZmM4UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;thetraveler.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQaC1PdTRyOWdZbmRJOFZCTjBURF9yMkV6aUEyeHZhT0tMbUpjYmxIeTV3R2t5dmFRNFVvQWNPWHg5WTRaOUplTnpGazJWUUd2aXRUSTVlZ2ZUbG1Nai1OR1hqcVd1VFIzQlFESmVkc3J3U0ExTGZadzBSck5Yd1ZFbDVqZ2ZHcGVkeHZGR0ROYldXeFB4bGtxWHZOMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;thetraveler.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQdmpIcGw1c3phR1dudG9YZy1tWVRobGJhcFBaOEMxay13RDg5UWRzR0ZuVzR